# Phase H smoke — minimal offline stack (isolated project dify-b8-phase-h)

Date: 2026-08-12 (UTC smoke window ~15:46–15:58)
Host port: only 127.0.0.1:18080
Stack: db_postgres + redis + api + web + nginx (all isolated, `--pull never`),
volumes remapped to named volumes `dify-b8-phase-h-*`.

